00:20:13,837 --> 00:20:15,255
We have to go already.

291
00:20:21,094 --> 00:20:21,804
What?

292
00:20:22,231 --> 00:20:24,025
Why are his hands so cold?

293
00:20:24,653 --> 00:20:25,821
Is he freezing?

294
00:20:28,997 --> 00:20:31,208
Or is he hot?
His palms are sweaty.

295
00:20:31,689 --> 00:20:33,566
I wonder what's wrong with Hubby.

296
00:20:37,553 --> 00:20:39,471
Nice meeting you, Mrs. Roswell.

297
00:20:40,272 --> 00:20:41,941
Oh, just Aemie.

298
00:20:42,483 --> 00:20:43,901
Excuse me, Mr. Ferrer.

299
00:20:43,901 --> 00:20:46,654
Please fill out this form
for the delivery details

300
00:20:46,654 --> 00:20:48,498
of that vanity table.

301
00:20:48,572 --> 00:20:51,033
So you liked this vanity table too?

302
00:20:51,659 --> 00:20:53,869
