<i>🎵 Over both of us 🎵</i>

457
00:33:14,067 --> 00:33:18,196
<i>🎵 Meant to be 🎵</i>

458
00:33:28,164 --> 00:33:33,670
<i>🎵 All the stars are watching 🎵</i>

459
00:33:34,170 --> 00:33:38,758
<i>🎵 Over both of us 🎵</i>

460
00:33:40,427 --> 00:33:45,932
<i>🎵 All the stars are watching 🎵</i>

461
00:33:46,516 --> 00:33:51,104
<i>🎵 Over both of us 🎵</i>

