daughter and she's really just part of—

508
00:36:51,159 --> 00:36:52,410
Boss loves...

509
00:36:53,495 --> 00:36:54,662
Ma'am Aemie.

510
00:36:55,580 --> 00:36:57,707
Ever since he met her, he changed.

511
00:36:58,958 --> 00:37:03,171
He's no longer as heartless as he was
before, but he can be ruthless for her.

512
00:37:03,546 --> 00:37:05,423
