He said we'd meet here.

561
00:39:43,556 --> 00:39:44,265
And...

562
00:39:45,433 --> 00:39:47,060
where are we even gonna eat?

563
00:39:58,446 --> 00:39:59,072
<i>Hey!</i>

564
00:39:59,530 --> 00:40:01,366
<i>Aren't you supposed </i>
<i>to be at the office?</i>

565
00:40:01,366 --> 00:40:03,576
<i>You still have a lot to finish.</i>

566
00:40:03,826 --> 00:40:05,286
<i>Where the hell are you?</i>

567
00:40:05,495 --> 00:40:06,955
I'll be right back.

568
00:40:06,955 --> 00:40:08,539
I'm just having lunch with Mr. Ken.

569
00:40:09,040 --> 00:40:10,291
Tell Zeke for me, okay?

570
00:40:10,875 --> 00:40:11,626
And also,

571
00:40:11,918 --> 00:40:13,753
tell him I love you.

572
00:40:14,629 --> 00:40:16,214
<i>Are you insulting me?</i>

573
00:40:18,216 --> 00:40:19,258
Oh my god!

574
00:40:20,009 --> 00:40:22,595
Did she think I was
saying "I love you" to her?

575
00:40:23,680 --> 00:40:25,056
She's so full of herself.

576
00:40:27,016 --> 00:40:29,060
That "I love you"
was for Zeke, not you.

577
00:40:33,231 --> 00:40:34,649
Where's Mr. Ken?

578
00:40:36,192 --> 00:40:37,485
Why isn't he here yet?

579
00:40:51,040 --> 00:40:52,750
Why are they wearing masks?

580
00:40:53,751 --> 00:40:55,253
Do they not want
to be recognized?

581
00:40:56,045 --> 00:40:57,380
Come with us.

582
00:41:01,478 --> 00:41:02,312
Hey.

583
00:41:02,635 --> 00:41:03,678
So you're awake.

584
00:41:04,128 --> 00:41:05,254
Aren't you scared of us?

585
00:41:05,254 --> 00:41:06,047
Why?

586
00:41:07,170 --> 00:41:08,004
Are you ghosts?

587
00:41:08,029 --> 00:41:10,319
- Where's my daughter?
- We need to talk first.

588
00:41:10,343 --> 00:41:11,720
Something happened yesterday.

589
00:41:11,732 --> 00:41:12,691
Yes, I heard.

590
00:41:12,693 --> 00:41:13,569
Yaji.

591
00:41:14,904 --> 00:41:15,779
Impossible.

592
00:41:16,766 --> 00:41:18,434
I know how Yaji operates.

593
00:41:18,601 --> 00:41:20,144
They want to over rule.

594
00:41:20,311 --> 00:41:22,480
If what you're saying
is true, Roswell.

595
00:41:22,490 --> 00:41:24,409
Yaji needs a queen to play her role.

596
00:41:24,701 --> 00:41:25,660
They need you.

597
00:41:35,341 --> 00:41:35,884
Aemie!

598
00:41:42,677 --> 00:41:45,013
We've been trying to
convince them for years.

599
00:41:46,180 --> 00:41:47,515
They just won't budge.

600
00:41:47,515 --> 00:41:49,392
Why aren't you answering
your phone, Aemie?

601
00:41:49,392 --> 00:41:51,286
Maybe Aemie's phone
just died, Mr. Roswell.

602
00:41:51,310 --> 00:41:53,521
You know your wife.
She never charges it.

603
00:41:53,993 --> 00:41:55,953
I have a bad feeling
about this, Lamperouge.

604
00:41:58,023 --> 00:41:58,815
Zeke!
